<div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><h1>{{ page.title | escape }}</h1></header><div class="page-prose rte">{% if page.content != blank %}{{ page.content }}{% else %}<h2>From the everyday.</h2><p>A train cutting through smoke. Chai in the rain. A quiet stretch of coast. The small moments of everyday India carry stories of their own.</p><p>We bring those moments into expressive illustrations and pared-back clothing. Our Regular fit carries the artwork on the front with a plain back. Oversized carries it on the back with a plain front.</p><h2>Room to be yourself.</h2><p>Regular and Oversized are two directions for the same idea: choose the silhouette that feels like you, then find the artwork you want to carry.</p><h2>Made with intention.</h2><p>We are refining the artwork and reviewing physical samples, with attention to print clarity, proportion and how each piece feels when worn.</p>{% endif %}</div></div>
